Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by changes in the behavior of the HTTP client and HTTP core libraries, which led to differences in the exception messages generated when proxy connections failed. The tests were previously validating specific messages in the exceptions to ensure expected behavior, but due to the library upgrade, these messages no longer matched, resulting in test failures.

